# A page whose ticket hasn't landed (source/screens/nav.c): A on home's
# first item (Recent: the card's v0.3 list has two games) fades home out and
# the page in (every frame hashed): its title bar with the item's icon and
# name, an empty card, and B back in the hint bar. B fades back to home,
# facing the item.
-w "nav: home ready"
-k @8:A -k @12:-
-H @8:@30
-w "nav: page recent ready"
-s @1:page.png
-k @8:B -k @12:-
-w "nav: home ready"
-s @1:back.png
